        "created_at": "2015-06-16T15:29:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Seriously, guys. This is NOT my kind of game, and yet I love it. Matt and Ben somehow figured out a way to make a real-time dice-rolling game that is a blast to play, regardless of winning or losing. And the action that goes on throughout the game drips with delicious thematic monster truck mayhem. Go check it out.&nbsp;</p>",
